    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`isolcpus` removes CPUs from the load balancer. `nohz_full` disables the scheduler tick on those CPUs (tasks run without periodic interruption). `rcu_nocbs` offloads RCU callbacks to other CPUs.",
      "source_hash": 2907790598412083905,
      "context_hash": 14331453621680123751,
